but we've been calling this humanity's last problem.

51
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:23,480
当人类再也无法监控智能体并发现其中的问题时
When humans are no longer able to monitor agents and find issues with them,

52
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:25,560
那它们就已经远远超前于我们了
then they're just way ahead of where we are.

53
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:28,780
因此 这是当今时代最重要的问题之一
And so this is one of the most important problems of our time,

54
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:31,760
就是发现生产环境中的智能体问题
is catching issues in production agents.

55
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:36,040
要在生产环境中构建可靠的智能体
So to build reliable agents in production,

56
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,020
并确保你能够对它们进行监控
and to make sure you can monitor them,

57
00:03:38,060 --> 00:03:39,760
你需要一套良好的信号体系
you need a good set of signals.

58
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,900
那么 什么是信号呢
So what are signals?

59
00:03:41,980 --> 00:03:44,060
在我们看来 主要有两大类
There's two real types that we think of,

60
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:47,100
隐式信号和显式信号
implicit signals and explicit signals.

61
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:51,720
隐式信号更多关注正在发生事情的语义层面
Implicit signals deal with sort of the semantic nature of what's going on,

62
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:55,560
而显式信号则对应客观现实
and explicit signals deal with objective reality,

63
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:59,160
也就是那些可以被验证真假的东西
things that are verifiably true or false.

64
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:03,000
比如 显式信号包括错误率这样的指标
For example, explicit signals are things like error rate.

65
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:07,200
你确实需要监控你的工具错误率以及其他正在发生的错误
You really want to be monitoring your tool error rate and other errors that are happening,

66
00:04:07,980 --> 00:04:12,780
还有延迟 用户重新生成的次数 或者成本
or latency, or users regenerating, or the cost.

67
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:14,620
如果这些指标中任何一个突然飙升
If any of these things spike,

68
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:17,060
比如你看到智能体的错误率突然升高
right, if you're seeing error rates spike in your agent,

69
00:04:17,280 --> 00:04:20,000
通常就意味着某些地方出了问题
that's usually a good sign that something is wrong.

70
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,020
而如果这些指标一直很平
And if you see it flat,

71
00:04:21,220 --> 00:04:22,960
这本身也可能说明一些情况
that could mean something as well.

72
00:04:23,220 --> 00:04:25,680
延迟 重新生成次数和成本也是同样的道理
Same thing with latency, regenerations, or cost.

73
00:04:27,300 --> 00:04:30,240
隐式信号则非常有趣
Implicit signals are interesting,

74
